---
import type { IndustryDetail as Detail } from '../../data/industries';
const { data } = Astro.props as { data: Detail };
---
<section class="detail-hero"><div class="wrap rv"><span class="eyebrow">Industry / {data.title}</span><h1>{data.title}</h1><p>{data.short}</p></div></section><section class="page-section detail-overview"><div class="wrap detail-grid"><div class="rv"><span class="eyebrow">Overview</span><h2>Systems shaped around the work.</h2></div><p class="detail-lead rv">{data.overview}</p></div></section><section class="page-section detail-dark dark"><div class="wrap detail-columns"><article class="rv"><span class="eyebrow">Challenges</span><h2>What the system needs to handle.</h2><ul>{data.challenges.map(x=><li>{x}</li>)}</ul></article><article class="rv"><span class="eyebrow">Lingaasys Solutions</span><h2>How we can approach it.</h2><ul>{data.solutions.map(x=><li>{x}</li>)}</ul></article></div></section><section class="page-section detail-tech"><div class="wrap"><div class="detail-split"><div class="rv"><span class="eyebrow">Relevant Technology</span><h2>A stack chosen for the workflow.</h2></div><div class="tag-row rv">{data.technology.map(x=><span>{x}</span>)}</div></div><div class="workflow-strip rv"><span class="eyebrow">Example System Workflow</span><div>{data.workflow.map((x,i)=><article><small>0{i+1}</small><strong>{x}</strong></article>)}</div></div></div></section><section class="page-section outcomes"><div class="wrap rv"><span class="eyebrow">Outcomes</span><h2>What the system is designed to support.</h2><div class="outcome-grid">{data.outcomes.map(x=><div>{x}</div>)}</div><div class="page-cta"><a class="btn p" href="/contact">Let's Build Something Meaningful</a><a class="btn k" href="/industries">Back to Industries</a></div></div></section>